{"Title":"An Act authorizing Holly Thyng to purchase creditable service from the Barnstable County Retirement Board","BillNumber":"H3652","DocketNumber":"HD1531","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T16:27:25.457"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T16:27:25.4566667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3652/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peake of Provincetown, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3652) of Sarah K. Peake (with the approval of the county commissioners) that Holly Thyng be authorized to purchase creditable service from the Barnstable County Retirement Board.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Barnstable county retirement board shall permit Holly Thyng, a member of said system, to purchase creditable service for her time with the Brewster fire department pursuant to the provisions of section 4(1) of chapter 32.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}